  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bf2d7532251303545ab78ab68b00d5cf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 17F02_TerminalSignoff_A
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sequenceId: 17F02_TerminalSignoff_A
  notes: '17F02 option A sign-off and 17F03 alert. Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_Expanded_Native_English_Lobby_Mia_Commentary.md,
    stable marker 17F02_TerminalSignoff_A. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync
    All Dialogue From Final Script.'
  lines:
  - startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Correct disposition. Restart signal sent. The repair module will activate
      within thirty seconds. Stability is projected to return to the safe range within
      twenty-four hours.
    holdSeconds: 10.5839615
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: The household will also enter a fourteen-day priority watch. If the relationship
      becomes unstable again, I will flag it. Two reviews completed within specification
      tonight, Inspector.
    holdSeconds: 10.96132
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Next, proceed to 17F-03 for the final inspection on tonight's route.
    holdSeconds: 5.3009434
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Inspector, 17F-03 went offline ten minutes ago. My restart signal is receiving
      no response, and I cannot read the household from the corridor. You will need
      to enter.
    holdSeconds: 11.716038
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
